---
import { stats } from '../../data/network'
---

<section class="border-b-2 border-[var(--ink)]">
  <div class="container-app">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-0 border-x-2 border-[var(--ink)]">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 cell border-b-2 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r-2 border-[var(--ink)] min-h-[min(100dvh,var(--nav-h)+520px)] flex flex-col justify-between reveal">
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono-ui text-[var(--hazard)] mb-6">Rev 3.0 / Unit KC-01 / Pacific Corridor</p>
          <h1 class="text-mega text-[var(--ink)]">
            Juche<br /><span class="text-[var(--hazard)]">Gang</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="font-ko text-base text-[var(--muted)] mt-6 max-w-md">한국과 캐나다를 잇는 통일과 인공지능</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 lg:mt-0">
          <p class="text-base max-w-lg leading-relaxed bilingual">
            Bridging Korean diaspora communities in Canada with strategic intelligence, civic infrastructure, and AI-orchestrated collaboration.
            <span class="ko block">캐나다 한인 디아스포라와 전략 인텔리전스, 시민 인프라, AI 협업을 태평양 회랑에서 연결합니다.</span>
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-0 mt-8 border-2 border-[var(--ink)] w-fit">
            <a href="#network" class="btn-primary border-0">Network</a>
            <a href="https://juchegang.ca/the-current" class="btn-hazard border-0 border-l-2 border-[var(--ink)]">The Current</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative min-h-[280px] lg:min-h-0 halftone-img reveal">
        <img
          src="/images/hero-pacific-corridor.jpg"
          alt="Pacific corridor blueprint connecting Korea and Canada"
          width="800"
          height="600"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full"
        />
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 bg-[var(--paper)] border-t-2 border-[var(--ink)]">
          <p class="font-mono-ui text-[var(--muted)]">Fig. 01 / Pacific Corridor / KC Division</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="blueprint-grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 border-x-2 border-b-2 border-[var(--ink)] reveal">
      {stats.map(stat => (
        <div class="cell text-center">
          <data value={stat.value} class="stat-num block text-[var(--ink)]">{stat.value}</data>
          <p class="font-mono-ui mt-2 text-[var(--ink)]">{stat.label}</p>
          <p class="font-ko text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mt-1">{stat.labelKo}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>